      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَؤُوسٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَائِسٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also A camel <i>having no
fatness</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طِرْق</span>) <i>remaining except in the head;</i> (S,
K;) and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرَائِسٌ</span></b> , (S, TA,) incorrectly said in
the K to be ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرَأَّسٌ</span></b> , like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعَظَّمٌ</span>; (TA;) mentioned
by A' Obeyd, from Fr.; (S;) so too ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرْآسٌ</span></b> . (K.)

